## Resolving it

- `AGENTS.md`, at the repository root, says how to work here. `make ready`
  passes before every commit.
- Test what the code is for: a test that runs lines without checking what they
  do raises the figure and catches nothing.
- Open a pull request that says `Fixes` and this issue's number, so that
  merging it closes this issue.
- devtool files no second issue about coverage while this one is open: it
  finds this one by the comment at the top, and brings it up to date each
  time it measures again. Leave that comment as it is.

